  "description": "Roslyn source generator that materialises OpenTelemetry semantic-conventions constants, first-class definitions, and thin helpers for user-declared partial classes. Emits stable/incubating projections for attribute constants, Activity setters, and metric/span/event/entity definitions (typed against the Qyl.Telemetry.SemanticConventions package) from the pinned OpenTelemetry semantic-conventions v1.44.0 core registry plus the pinned development GenAI registry.",
